        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Name the feather type before you fill another drawer. This aisle holds the wide shelf: marabou, hackle, CDC, waterfowl, and specialty accents from Spawn Select and other brands.</p><h3>Marabou</h3><p>Soft, mobile fiber for tails, wings, and streamer movement.</p><h3>Saddle / neck hackle</h3><p>Dry-fly float and legs, or soft hackle wraps when the feather is webby enough. Match stem and fiber length to the hook.</p><h3>CDC</h3><p>Light, trap-air fiber for dry flies and emergers. Keep it clean; oil kills the loft.</p><h3>Waterfowl</h3><p>Wings, collars, soft hackles. Barred wood duck and similar packs when the pattern shows the feather.</p><h3>Specialty</h3><p>Ostrich herl, peacock, guinea, and other accents. Buy for the pattern, not to fill every empty bin.</p><h3>Select vs the rest of this aisle</h3><p>This page is the wide shelf. Spawn Select waterfowl (curated grading) lives on <a href=\"/collections/fly-tying-feathers\">Fly Tying Feathers Select</a>. Use Select when the fly shows the feather. Use this aisle when you need brand breadth or a specific SKU.</p><h3>Spawn Super Select barred wood duck</h3><p>When you need clean barring for wings and accents, start with our wood duck pack. More bench stock sits under <a href=\"/collections/fly-tying-materials\">Fly Tying Materials</a> and <a href=\"/collections/tails-fins-claws-more\">Tails, Fins, Claws &amp; More</a>.</p>"
          }
