          "settings": {
            "heading": "Natural vs dyed feathers?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Natural shows how the bird grew. Dyed keeps structure and gives a consistent color. Use natural when barring is the point. Use dyed when you need a specific shade across a batch.</p>"
